{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226750","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226750","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422675001:1":{"text":"諸君、おぬしらの行いは、すべて鹿霊に伝わっておるぞ。","source_cn":"诸位，你们所做的一切，鹿灵都已知晓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD3B026F5835FA53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422675002:1":{"text":"そして、ここが次の試練――地脈とのつながりを結ぶ場所じゃ。","source_cn":"而祂也予以指引，此处则是考验的下一步——与地脉建立联系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC30540F45557EC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422675003:1":{"text":"水脈は川に浸かるのが条件でしたが、まさか、地脈の場合は地面に穴を掘って入るとでも……？","source_cn":"与水脉联系要泡到河里，与地脉联系，总不能是挖个坑埋了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF15D1D08FAC5D5C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422675004:1":{"text":"ほっほほほ、その必要はない。水に浸かるのは、贖罪の資格があるか確かめるために、ターラン川が与えた試練じゃ。","source_cn":"哈哈哈，不用不用，浸入水中，是塔兰河的考验——为了证明...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E66892E1072820A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422675005:1":{"text":"インドラは十分にその誠意を示した。故に、ここではその贖罪を行うのじゃよ。","source_cn":"而在因度厄证明自身的诚意之后，此处则是赎罪的部分了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25622C2C87533F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"